  "citation": "Pepperman, W. (2026). LSJ-Gold: lemmatizer accuracy on the dictionary-cited stratum of Ancient Greek. Galen Density Project v3.0, doi:10.5281/zenodo.24046260 (concept doi:10.5281/zenodo.21561962)",
  "how_to_submit": "open a pull request adding submissions/<system>/<stem>.jsonl token caches ({i, surface, lemma} per token of the covered editions); CI scores them with `greek-lemma-audit lsjgold` and the maintainers add the row at the next version (see submissions/README.md)",
  "erratum": "Corrections (0.1.2, 2026-11): every locus that rested only on a single word LSJ quotes, where Dilemma gives the form another lemma (652 loci), was read blind by two readers with salted controls; 313 that were not accepted by both are dropped (LSJ often quotes a related word in an entry, which passed as the headword's own form). 1,364 rows that repeated a locus are removed, and 49 tokens that were gold under two different headwords are set aside. 70,198 loci remain; every system is rescored on the same outputs. 0.1 and 0.1.1 stay citable."
